# ROOFCAT: a sensible player gets through the whole first area. The demo
# player presses real buttons each frame: it keeps B held, stays in the left
# half of the screen, jumps gaps and walls, hops over what is about to hit
# it, turns round for what comes from behind, and as a spirit floats to a
# safe roof before coming back. It must reach the second area (screen 13,
# about two and a half minutes in) without a game over, scoring on the way.
game roofcat
wait 20
botuntil state == 2 200
expect area == 0
botuntil area == 1 9000
expect state == 2
expect lives >= 0
expect score >= 1500
expect kills >= 10
